1
00:00:00,719 --> 00:00:01,759
(Sheldon:)Oh, my.

2
00:00:19,613 --> 00:00:22,573
(Sheldon:)I've admired these for years.

3
00:00:22,741 --> 00:00:25,241
(Raj:)Does that mean
we can go out with the girls again?

4
00:00:25,410 --> 00:00:29,210
(Sheldon:)Hulk agree to second date
with puny humans.

5
00:00:32,125 --> 00:00:34,295
(Raj:)You can't wear the hands on the date.

6
00:00:37,339 --> 00:00:39,759
(Sheldon:)Hulk sad.

7
00:00:43,428 --> 00:00:45,258
(Leonard:)Hey.

8
00:00:46,807 --> 00:00:49,977
(Leonard:)Cleaning out the old dryer lint, huh?

9
00:00:50,978 --> 00:00:53,438
(Leonard:)Not only is it courteous,
it's safety-smart.

10
00:00:53,605 --> 00:00:59,025
(Leonard:)Every year, 15,000 fires are caused
by accidental dryer-lint ignition.

